{"anim_count":1,"animations":[{"index":0,"preset_class":1,"preset_id":42,"preset_subtype":0,"seq_type":"STTLTimeNodeType_mainSeq","shape_id":"0003ae","trigger_id":"kDefaultTriggerId"}],"page_id":"00001e","page_index":21,"shape_count":7,"shapes":[{"font_name":"思源黑体 CN Normal","font_size":20.0,"h":327,"id":"0003ae","text":"Properties + IO\rxxx.properties文件称为属性配置文件。\r属性配置文件可以配置一些简单的信息，例如连接数据库的信息通常配置到属性文件中。这样可以做到在不修改java代码的前提下，切换数据库。\r属性配置文件的格式：\rkey1=value1\rkey2=value2\rkey3=value3\r注意：使用 # 进行注释。key不能重复，key重复则value覆盖。key和value之间用等号分割。等号两边不要有空格。\rJava中如何读取属性配置文件？\r当然，也可以使用Java中的工具类快速获取配置信息：ResourceBundle\r这种方式要求文件必须是xxx.properties\r属性配置文件必须放在类路径当中\r","type":"shape","w":755,"x":88,"y":94},{"children":[{"fill":"ED7D31","font_name":"思源黑体 CN Medium","font_size":16.0,"h":0,"id":"0003af","rot":45.0,"text":"\r","type":"shape","w":0,"x":0,"y":0},{"fill":"01255A","font_name":"思源黑体 CN Medium","font_size":16.0,"h":0,"id":"0003b0","rot":45.0,"text":"\r","type":"shape","w":0,"x":0,"y":0},{"font_name":"思源黑体 CN Medium","h":0,"id":"0003b1","text":"\r","type":"shape","w":0,"x":0,"y":0}],"h":31,"id":"0003b2","type":"group","w":37,"x":39,"y":24},{"fill":"none","font_name":"思源黑体 CN Bold","font_size":24.0,"h":39,"id":"0003b3","text":"14读取属性配置文件\r\r","type":"shape","w":530,"x":85,"y":22},{"h":74,"id":"0003b4","img":"pptx:\\ppt\\media\\image3.png/qbb9nm","type":"picture","w":370,"x":696,"y":0},{"h":76,"id":"0003b5","img":"pptx:\\ppt\\media\\image10.png/qbb9nm","type":"picture","w":205,"x":89,"y":448},{"h":63,"id":"0003b6","img":"pptx:\\ppt\\media\\image11.png/qbb9nm","type":"picture","w":311,"x":299,"y":448},{"h":106,"id":"0003b7","img":"pptx:\\ppt\\media\\image12.png/qbb9nm","type":"picture","w":236,"x":615,"y":406}],"version":0}
